# THE HAND MODEL THE GAME LOADS IS TRACKED (2026-09-25).
#
# hand_left_poses.iqm used to be ignored, together with the Ermac glove, because
# both are derived from iAmErmac's work (Rusted Legacy, MIT) and this repo has a
# GitHub remote. The glove is gone now -- its weights were never cleaned up after
# the transfer and the fingers fused the moment a joint turned -- so those two
# lines are dead.
#
# hand_left_poses.iqm is NOT dead: it is the model MODELDEF actually loads, 1705
# frames, and ignoring it meant the hand every player wears had no backup in
# version control. hand_left.iqm (1298 frames) was tracked, so losing the live one
# meant rebuilding it through the whole chain -- Blender bake from hand_final.fbx,
# append two poses, splice Ermac's frames back on. That is not a backup.
#
# The licence is MIT, so what it asks for is attribution, not exclusion, and the
# credit is already in the build script and in tools/README.md. Pushing this repo
# now publishes the model; that is a decision about a push, not a reason to leave
# the asset unbacked.
